features.description:
At 10th level, your connection to the divine strengthens further. As an action, you can tap into the inherent authority of divinity to cause one of the following effects;

Bane's Malevolence. Hostile creatures within 10 feet of you must make a Charisma saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, they are affected by the bane spell for 1 minute. A creature affected by this feature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success. Blessing of Radiance. Friendly creatures within 10 feet of you gain the benefits of the bless spell. Once per turn, a creature affected by this feature can add a d4 to one attack roll or saving throw before the next turn ends.

You can use this feature once and regain all uses upon finishing a long rest. Additionally, while within your Divine Space hostile creatures always act as if under the bane spell and all friendly creatures act as if under the bless spell.
